# Allowlist: exclude everything, then include only what the Dockerfile copies.
# Keep in sync with the COPY instructions in the Dockerfile.
*

# Site files
!index.html
!main.css
!notifications.json
!robots.txt
!sitemap.xml

# Asset directories
!icons/
!images/
!logos/

# Pages
!faq/

# Re-exclude junk that may live inside the allowed directories
**/.DS_Store
**/._*
**/Thumbs.db
**/Desktop.ini
**/*.swp
**/*.swo
**/*~
